                        heading="State of Digital Experience 2025"
                        model="features-item"
                        name="Features Item"
                        text="&lt;p>Our annual benchmark report surveying 500+ enterprise digital leaders across 12 industries. Covers AI adoption in DXP, personalization maturity, content operations benchmarks, and top digital experience priorities for 2025–2026.&lt;/p>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Format:&lt;/strong> PDF Whitepaper, 42 pages&lt;/p>"/>
