                        ctaUrl="/content/my-dxp-site/contact"
                        heading="AI-First DXP Buyer's Guide"
                        model="features-item"
                        name="Features Item"
                        text="&lt;p>A practical evaluation framework for digital experience platform selection. Covers 40 capability criteria, vendor comparison methodology, RFP template, and a scoring model you can adapt to your organization's specific requirements.&lt;/p>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Format:&lt;/strong> PDF Guide + Excel Scorecard&lt;/p>"/>
