                        ctaUrl="/content/my-dxp-site/contact"
                        heading="ROI Calculator &amp; Business Case Template"
                        model="features-item"
                        name="Features Item"
                        text="&lt;p>Build a compelling business case for DXP AI with our interactive ROI calculator and executive presentation template. Covers cost savings, revenue impact, content production efficiency, and risk reduction — pre-filled with industry benchmarks.&lt;/p>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Format:&lt;/strong> Excel Calculator + PowerPoint Template&lt;/p>"/>
